msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The cathedral standing tall in the center of town.⟪k:1⟫The stone-paved streets clacking with "
"the pleasant sound of footsteps.⟪k:2⟫The people peering out from beneath awnings to look up at "
"the sky."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫此时此刻，⟪k:1⟫无论是市中心矗立的教堂、⟪k:2⟫回响着轻快脚步声的鹅卵石小道、⟪k:3⟫还是从自家屋前"
"探出脸仰望天空的居民……"

