#: scenario:scenario_3889ECE8_14D0_4B02_A043_8975F3066FAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b69867eda3ae405b3cbce8919d18d6f7b94bb54bc6038c7a77359a59393e086
