msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫不对，⟪k:7⟫不对！⟪k:8⟫要我重复几遍你才能听懂？"

#: scenario:scenario_7028109B_CC5D_4B0E_9059_F147BB0704AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74bafe49e9e8e9ff3b3473268b2acc025b4ee5945a53359778124a7dd9b363b5
